# Cueva Secreta, floor 2 (C9, contract 56), 30 x 24, a cave (post-game). The ladder from floor 1 arrives in the SE hall (ladder (24,20), spawn from_1); the halls wind north and west to the ladder up (8,3).
# Wild L52 - 58; items: Ultra Crystal, Prime Salve, the Special / Defense / Speed vitamins.
@map cueva_secreta_2
@size 30 24
@interior no
@cave yes
@area cueva_secreta
@bg 0
@fill crysg
@spawn from_1 24 19 N
@spawn from_3 8 4 S
@encounters grass rate=12
  cragodile 54 58 10
  tuskumo 54 58 10
  hoodcoil 52 56 10
  pyromeer 54 58 10
  sagatee 52 56 10
  gloomshroud 54 58 10
  pinekeeper 54 58 10
  voltbara 54 58 5
  slumberth 52 56 5
  tarbog 52 56 10
  twinkeg 52 56 10
  foldling 54 58 5
@end
